# duel-core

Slice 1 of the plan after the walking skeleton: the pure, deterministic 1v1 duel simulation of `docs/spec.md` §7 and §8 with the Duelist kit, rollback-ready snapshots and a replay runner. It is the contract the combat spike (`duel-online`) builds on. It runs in parallel with `world-sea`, so it owns only new directories and three `package.json` files.

- `feature.json`: one lane (`duel`), the bundled reviewers, `prd` = `docs/spec.md`.
- `policy.json`: owned paths and four checks (typecheck, unit, integration, build); no browser check.
- `duel-task.md`: the lane's outcome brief.
- `decisions.md`: the operator's decisions.

Launch from `~/dev/project-B`: `workflow launch duel-core --dry-run`, then the launch line in `CLAUDE.md`.
{
  "version": "2.2.0",
  "name": "The pure 1v1 duel simulation of \u00a77 and \u00a78: Duelist kit, guard, throw, stamina, combo rules, KO and timeout, rollback snapshots and a replay runner",
  "branch_prefix": "feature/duel-core",
  "prd": "docs/spec.md",
  "policy": "policy.json",
  "workers": [
    {
      "node_id": "duel",
      "task": "duel-task.md"
    }
  ],
  "reviewers": [
    {
      "reviewer_id": "general",
      "prompt": "builtin:general"
    },
    {
      "reviewer_id": "coverage",
      "prompt": "builtin:coverage"
    }
  ]
}
{
  "version": "1.2.0",
  "feature": "Pirate Sea Race duel core",
  "independent_review": true,
  "integration_approval": true,
  "max_verification_attempts": 3,
  "setup": [
    {
      "argv": [
        "npm",
        "ci"
      ],
      "timeout_seconds": 900
    }
  ],
  "workers": [
    {
      "node_id": "duel",
      "role": "simulation",
      "required_check_kinds": [
        "typecheck",
        "unit",
        "integration",
        "build"
      ],
      "owned_paths": [
        "packages/simulation/src/duel",
        "packages/simulation/package.json",
        "packages/content/src/moves",
        "packages/content/package.json",
        "packages/test-tools/src/replay",
        "packages/test-tools/package.json",
        "docs/duel.md"
      ],
      "checks": [
        {
          "id": "typecheck",
          "kind": "typecheck",
          "argv": [
            "npm",
            "run",
            "typecheck"
          ],
          "timeout_seconds": 300,
          "scenarios": []
        },
        {
          "id": "unit",
          "kind": "unit",
          "argv": [
            "npm",
            "run",
            "test:unit"
          ],
          "timeout_seconds": 300,
          "scenarios": []
        },
        {
          "id": "integration",
          "kind": "integration",
          "argv": [
            "npm",
            "run",
            "test:integration"
          ],
          "timeout_seconds": 300,
          "scenarios": []
        },
        {
          "id": "build",
          "kind": "build",
          "argv": [
            "npm",
            "run",
            "build"
          ],
          "timeout_seconds": 600,
          "scenarios": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{
  "name": "@pirate-sea-race/test-tools",
  "version": "0.0.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "Headless clients for integration tests (§17)",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "@pirate-sea-race/source": "./src/index.ts",
      "types": "./dist/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./dist/index.js"
    }
  },
  "files": [
    "dist",
    "src"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "build": "tsc -p tsconfig.build.json",
